    "reason": "The linked PR [ev-b0d8cf4ba6aa] says the server-side diff dry run now uses the new kube applier from gitops-engine. This avoids the error caused by appending kube command stderr to stdout. The linked issue [ev-bb9e7540628e][ev-53a4634f1a2c] shows that this error made server-side diff fail with an unmarshal error. So the same configuration now behaves differently at runtime: the dry run no longer breaks. That supports a behavior-changed change on a free-form subject named from the evidence's own key words, server-side-diff-dry-run [ev-aae2a6aa6ee6].",
